      "text": "��<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\"><html><body><p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"..\\image_chapter_15873.png\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">One of the major areas of study in Psychology is the study of psychological disorders. Please watch the following video which summarizes some of the historical treatments of psychological disorders and the major players in the development and evolution of treatment. The following topics will be covered:</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><ul><li>Defining Psychological Disorders</li><li>Perspectives on Mental Illness</li><li>Diagnosing Disorders with the DSM</li><li>DSM is Constantly Evolving<br></li></ul></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wuhJ-GkRRQc?list=PL8dPuuaLjXtOPRKzVLY0jJY-uHOH9KVU6\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p></p></body></html>",
